      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1622205674",
      "Source": "Keeps the Nameless at bay by injecting charge directly into the ground.<#N#><#N#>- Adjustable range (charge usage increases exponentially with radius)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"通过将电荷直接注入地面来阻挡无名怪。<#N#><#N#>- 可调范围（电荷消耗随半径呈指数级增长）","JA":""},
