    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::259645879",
      "Source": "Will take items from you or your dino that have associated nearby dedicated storage units.<#N#><#N#>Can be upgraded in size. (does not change distribution range)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"会从你或你的恐龙处收取与附近专用存储单元相关联的物品。<#N#><#N#>可升级尺寸。（不改变分配范围）","JA":""},
