    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3944237948",
      "Source": "- Distributes fertilizer to nearby crop plots.<#N#>- Will collect fertilizer from nearby compost bins and dung beetles.<#N#>- Can use Tek Generator or Calien Soup for fuel (will automatically use fuel if no power is available)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"- 向附近耕地分配肥料。<#N#>- 会从附近废料箱和蜣螂处收集肥料。<#N#>- 可使用泰克发电机或卡琳汤作为燃料（无电力时会自动使用燃料）","JA":""},
