    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1421632809",
      "Source": "Harvests nearby resources & Plant Species R. Can upload to B+dedicated storage (map wide).<#RN#><#RN#>Equip a Dermis & a weapon to improve harvest quantity.<#RN#><#RN#>** Can only be powered by a Tek Gen or battery **",
      "Trans": {"SC":"采集附近资源与R型植物。可上传至B+专用存储（全地图）。<#RN#><#RN#>装备真皮与武器可提高采集数量。<#RN#><#RN#>** 仅可由泰克发电机或电池供电 **","JA":""},
