    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::255331845",
      "Source": "Allows nearby dinos to be hitched, preventing them from moving even when set to wander.<#N#><#N#>Hitched dinos will not go into stasis.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"允许附近恐龙被拴住，即使设置为徘徊也无法移动。<#N#><#N#>被拴住的恐龙不会进入停滞状态。","JA":""},
