    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3384273708",
      "Source": "Allows nearby dinos to be hitched, preventing them from moving even when set to wander.<#RN#><#RN#>Hitched dinos will not go into stasis. Achatina has increased production rates.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"允许附近恐龙被拴住，即使设置为徘徊也无法移动。<#RN#><#RN#>被拴住的恐龙不会进入停滞状态。玛瑙螺的产量会增加。","JA":""},
