    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4242979789",
      "Source": "- Gives food to nearby babies (under 15%)<#N#>- Imprints nearby non-adult dinos<#N#>- Can place preserving salt in inventory<#N#>- Just requires power",
      "Trans": {"SC":"- 向附近幼崽（15%以下）提供食物<#N#>- 印记附近非成年恐龙<#N#>- 可在库存中放置防腐盐<#N#>- 仅需电力","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1399977082",
      "Source": "A platform sits at the top of the surface of bodies of water.<#RN#><#RN#>- Has mutliple variants (use radial menu)<#RN#>- Can be snapped together<#RN#><#RN#>** Ladders not included **",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一个位于水面顶部的平台。<#RN#><#RN#>- 有多种变体（使用轮盘菜单）<#RN#>- 可吸附拼接<#RN#><#RN#>** 不包含梯子 **","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2754538145",
      "Source": "Places on platform saddles & rafts, has snap points for walls, ceilings, etc.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"放置在平台鞍与木筏上，有墙、天花板等的吸附点。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::104764457",
      "Source": "Breeds dinos from cryopods & produces eggs that display the stats/colors including which parent it was inherited from & any mutations.<#N#><#N#>Can modify dinos gender, ability to breed & offspring mutations.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"从冷冻舱中繁殖恐龙，产出显示属性/颜色（包括继承自哪一方父母及任何突变）的蛋。<#N#><#N#>可修改恐龙性别、繁殖能力及后代突变。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::162140039",
      "Source": "Breeds dinos from cryopods & produces eggs that display the stats/colors including which parent it was inherited from & any mutations.<#RN#>Dino must be able to breed normally, have a gender and lay eggs (no gestation dinos)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"从冷冻舱中繁殖恐龙，产出显示属性/颜色（包括继承自哪一方父母及任何突变）的蛋。<#RN#>恐龙必须能正常繁殖、有性别且产卵（无妊娠恐龙）","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2035204792",
      "Source": "Automatically repairs armor and weapons placed inside.<#N#><#N#>Requires resources for repair to also be in the repair station.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"自动修复内部放置的护甲与武器。<#N#><#N#>修复所需资源也需在修复台中。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
