      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1087723327",
      "Source": "Provides heavy physical protection and reduced physical torpor, but provides almost no protection from the elements. Adds stamina boost.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"提供厚重物理防护并减少物理麻醉，但几乎不提供元素防护。增加耐力增益。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3467751894",
      "Source": "These flippers are firm, but flexible.  Wearing them increases swim speed, but decreases walking speed. Adds speed boost.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这些脚蹼坚固但灵活。穿戴可增加游泳速度，但降低行走速度。增加速度增益。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1847481907",
      "Source": "Connects to a SCUBA tank, allowing the wearer to breathe underwater for as long as the tank has Oxygen. Adds health boost.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"连接至潜水氧气瓶，允许穿戴者在氧气瓶有氧气时水下呼吸。增加健康增益。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1481193951",
      "Source": "Provides little defense, but tremendous hyperthermal insulation specifically when underwater. Adds stamina boost.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"提供极少防御，但在水下时具有极强的超热绝缘。增加耐力增益。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::195529255",
      "Source": "Highly advanced boots capable of absorbing the impact of falling from high distances.<#RN#>Equipping requires learning this Tekgram. Adds speed boost.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"高度先进的靴子，可吸收从高处坠落的冲击力。<#RN#>装备需要学习此泰克蓝图。增加速度增益。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3270357042",
      "Source": "Highly advanced gauntlets that allow the wearer to perform devastating punches.<#RN#>Equipping requires learning this Tekgram. Adds melee boost.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"高度先进的护手，允许穿戴者施展毁灭性拳击。<#RN#>装备需要学习此泰克蓝图。增加近战增益。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1566137691",
      "Source": "Never get lost again with the Tek Helmets night vision. Also provides a targeting mode that reveals other characters' positions, and infinite oxygen while underwater.<#RN#>Equipping requires learning this Tekgram. Adds health boost.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"有了泰克头盔的夜视功能，再也不会迷路。还提供显示其他角色位置的瞄准模式，以及水下无限氧气。<#RN#>装备需要学习此泰克蓝图。增加健康增益。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::570323800",
      "Source": "Highly advanced leggings that allow for powerful forward movement. Equipping requires learning this Tekgram. Adds stamina boost.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"高度先进的护腿，允许强大的向前移动。装备需要学习此泰克蓝图。增加耐力增益。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2168380434",
      "Source": "Will take items from you that have associated nearby storage units.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"会从你处收取与附近存储单元相关联的物品。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::882906654",
      "Source": "Stores items, set a whitelist so the wireless intake pole can be used with this.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"存储物品，设置白名单以便无线摄入杆可与此配合使用。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3653997558",
      "Source": "Functions as a chemistry bench, can do resource conversions and make fertilizer.<#N#><#N#>Chemistry bench recipes output is doubled.<#N#><#N#>Requires a Tek Gen for power.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"用作化学工作台，可进行资源转换并制作肥料。<#N#><#N#>化学工作台配方产量翻倍。<#N#><#N#>需要泰克发电机供电。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2320824929",
      "Source": "Can make advanced recipes, kibble & beer. Produces twice the output of each recipe.<#N#><#N#>Pulls water from the air so doesn't need irrigation but requires a Tek Gen for power.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"可制作高级配方、饲料与啤酒。每个配方产量翻倍。<#N#><#N#>从空气中提取水分，因此无需灌溉，但需要泰克发电机供电。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4081918618",
      "Source": "Doesn't require a water jar to craft and doesn't return a water on use.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"制作无需水罐，使用时不返还水。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2211733481",
      "Source": "Instantly smelts metal into ingots, wood into charcoal, organic polymer into polymer & condensed gas into gas balls.<#N#><#N#>Only requires 1 metal per ingot.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"立即将金属熔炼成锭、木材制成木炭、有机聚合物制成聚合物、浓缩气体制成气体球。<#N#><#N#>每锭仅需1单位金属。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2176291741",
      "Source": "Can fill water containers & resets the spoil timer of items placed inside.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"可装满水容器并重置内部放置物品的腐烂计时器。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1471013149",
      "Source": "Extracts Oil from an Oil zone<#RN#><#RN#>- Can send oil back to B+Dedicated Storage.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"从油区提取石油<#RN#><#RN#>- 可将石油送回B+专用存储。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3388361761",
      "Source": "- Larger inventory<#RN#>- More reliable sap production<#RN#>- Will send sap back to B+Dedicated Storage.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"- 更大库存<#RN#>- 更可靠的树脂生产<#RN#>- 会将树脂送回B+专用存储。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1769007896",
      "Source": "Cooks meat instantly and can make jerky.<#N#><#N#>Requires Tek Gen for power.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"立即烹饪肉类并可制作肉干。<#N#><#N#>需要泰克发电机供电。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1972634914",
      "Source": "Converts creatures between their variations.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在生物的变体之间转换。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::248677803",
      "Source": "Has advanced targeting settings.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"具有高级瞄准设置。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3731813960",
      "Source": "Fires massive arrows which knockback hit enemies.<#N#><#N#>Uses Spear Bolts for ammo.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"发射巨大箭矢，击退命中的敌人。<#N#><#N#>使用矛箭作为弹药。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3039289788",
      "Source": "Fires cannon balls at things.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"向目标发射炮弹。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2374119546",
      "Source": "Spews fire at things. Will cause riders to dismount and unmounted dinos to flee.<#N#><#N#>Uses Flamethrower Ammo. (note: ignore targeting range, it has a set range regardless of setting)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"向目标喷射火焰。会导致骑手下马，未骑乘的恐龙逃跑。<#N#><#N#>使用火焰喷射器弹药。（注意：忽略瞄准范围，无论设置如何，它都有固定范围）","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2222945642",
      "Source": "Uses Advanced Sniper Ammo.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用高级狙击弹药。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3209769790",
      "Source": "- Has advanced targeting features.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"- 具有高级瞄准功能。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2112436548",
      "Source": "Fires rockets at things.<#N#><#N#>Note: Has a much higher targeting range than other turrets but will not target anything within 10 foundations of itself.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"向目标发射火箭。<#N#><#N#>注意：瞄准范围比其他炮台大得多，但不会瞄准自身10个地基范围内的任何目标。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::840499838",
      "Source": "Consumes Element Shards while firing.  Has a variety of smart-targeting configuration options.<#RN#><#RN#>- Lockable & Pin-codeable",
      "Trans": {"SC":"射击时消耗元素碎片。具有多种智能瞄准配置选项。<#RN#><#RN#>- 可锁定 & 可设置PIN码","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1416820126",
      "Source": "Tranquilizes things. Doesn't do any damage, will not target unconcious things.<#N#><#N#>Uses Shocking Tranquilizer Darts.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"麻醉目标。不造成任何伤害，不会瞄准无意识的目标。<#N#><#N#>使用电击麻醉镖。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3102552800",
      "Source": "Place filled cryopods inside to generate unfertilized eggs, poop & many other resources.<#RN#><#RN#>**Resources can only be collected by an B+Item Aggregator, they do not appear in the Vivarium's inventory**",
      "Trans": {"SC":"将装满的冷冻舱放入内部以生成未受精蛋、粪便及许多其他资源。<#RN#><#RN#>**资源仅可由B+物品调配器收集，不会出现在饲养器的库存中**","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
