    {
      "NamespaceHash": "9E9736894C8111B7A01FB98ABF93DAD4",
      "Source": "Hold Reload (PC: R) to open the mode select UI.<#RN#><#RN#>Some modes have sub-modes which can be toggled with the Targeting key (PC: Right Click).<#RN#><#RN#>Unlock Mode <#RN#>- Sub-modes: Unlock doors & Containers, Lock doors & Containers - if they were locked previously they will retain these settings.<#RN#>Hold shift for area mode.<#RN#><#RN#>Claim Mode<#RN#>-Sub-modes: Claim Dinos & Structures, Revert Claim to previous team.<#RN#>Hold shift for area mode.<#RN#><#RN#>Traits Mode<#RN#>-Sub-modes: Trait Selector Widget, Apply trait.<#RN#><#RN#>Resize Mode<#RN#>-Sub-modes: Resize dino, Revert dino to default size.<#RN#><#RN#>Destroy Mode<#RN#>Destroy any Dino and Structure.<#RN#>Hold shift for area mode.<#RN#>USE WITH CAUTION this will permanently destroy dinos & structures.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"按住换弹键（PC：R）打开模式选择界面。<#RN#><#RN#>部分模式包含子模式，可通过瞄准键（PC：右键）切换。<#RN#><#RN#>解锁模式 <#RN#>- 子模式：解锁门和容器、锁定门和容器 - 若之前已锁定，将保留原有设置。<#RN#>按住Shift键进入区域模式。<#RN#><#RN#>认领模式<#RN#>-子模式：认领恐龙和结构、将认领恢复到之前的团队。<#RN#>按住Shift键进入区域模式。<#RN#><#RN#>特性模式<#RN#>-子模式：特性选择组件、应用特性。<#RN#><#RN#>缩放模式<#RN#>-子模式：缩放恐龙、将恐龙恢复到默认尺寸。<#RN#><#RN#>破坏模式<#RN#>破坏任何恐龙和结构。<#RN#>按住Shift键进入区域模式。<#RN#>谨慎使用！这将永久摧毁恐龙和结构。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"2423480083"}
    },
