    {
      "NamespaceHash": "2C9F18EB44BEEA023C00A3A002284720",
      "Source": "B+Multi-Tool Info",
      "Trans": {"SC":"B+多功能手枪信息","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"1501163436"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "D336FA814CED5F0064A307A8B9753B9C",
      "Source": "Hold Reload (PC: R) to open the mode select UI.<#RN#><#RN#>Some modes have sub-modes which can be toggled with the Targeting key (PC: Right Click).<#RN#><#RN#>Structure Mode <#RN#>- Sub-modes: Pickup, Demolish & PU Internal (will pick up internal pipes & wires from structures)<#RN#><#RN#>Dino Mode<#RN#>- Sub-modes: Kill, Spay, Chibify, Toggle Mating, Toggle Ignore Whistles, Toggle Follow, Toggle Wandering, Toggle Creeping (whether dinos look at you) & Turret Mode<#RN#><#RN#>(note: Chibify will destroy target and everything on it, also level & color of dino has no impact on the created chibi)<#RN#><#RN#>Repair Mode<#RN#>- Attempts to repair your target (requires resources in your inventory)<#RN#><#RN#>Storage Settings Mode<#RN#>- Apply saved settings from B+Storage to another B+Storage<#RN#>- Sub-mode: Save settings<#RN#><#RN#>Light Mode<#RN#>- Works on B+Torches & Lights, opens the light settings UI<#RN#>- Targeting will save the settings of the target<#RN#><#RN#>Model Mode <#RN#>- Works on B+Crop plots & B+Glass<#RN#>- Alt Fire will save the settings of the target<#RN#><#RN#>Transparency Mode<#RN#>- Works on B+Glass<#RN#>-Alt Fire will save the settings of the target<#RN#><#RN#>Cryopod Mode<#RN#>-Captures the dino your looking at, tap Capslock/LB/L1 to toggle dropping dino inventory<#RN#>-Sub-Mode: Release the selected dino from the cryopod, tap run or Capslock/LB/L1 to alternate dinos<#RN#><#RN#>Dino Leveling Mode<#RN#>-Fire to apply saved level settings<#RN#>-Alt Fire will save level settings<#RN#>-Alt Fire whilst not targeting clears the level settings",
      "Trans": {"SC":"按住换弹键（PC：R）打开模式选择界面。<#RN#><#RN#>部分模式包含子模式，可通过瞄准键（PC：右键）切换。<#RN#><#RN#>结构模式 <#RN#>- 子模式：拾取、拆除及拾取内部（将从结构中拾取内部管道和电线）<#RN#><#RN#>恐龙模式<#RN#>- 子模式：击杀、绝育、转化为宠物、切换交配、切换忽略口哨、切换跟随、切换巡逻、切换友军凝视（恐龙是否注视你）及炮台模式<#RN#><#RN#>（注意：转化为宠物会摧毁目标及其上的所有物品，且恐龙的等级和颜色不影响生成的宠物）<#RN#><#RN#>维修模式<#RN#>- 尝试维修你的目标（需要背包中有资源）<#RN#><#RN#>存储设置模式<#RN#>- 将B+存储的保存设置应用到另一个B+存储<#RN#>- 子模式：保存设置<#RN#><#RN#>灯光模式<#RN#>- 适用于B+火把和灯，打开灯光设置界面<#RN#>- 瞄准将保存目标的设置<#RN#><#RN#>模型模式 <#RN#>- 适用于B+耕地和B+玻璃<#RN#>- 鼠标右键将保存目标的设置<#RN#><#RN#>透明度模式<#RN#>- 适用于B+玻璃<#RN#>-鼠标右键将保存目标的设置<#RN#><#RN#>低温舱模式<#RN#>-捕捉你注视的恐龙，点击Capslock/LB/L1切换是否掉落恐龙背包<#RN#>-子模式：从低温舱释放选中的恐龙，点击奔跑或Capslock/LB/L1切换恐龙<#RN#><#RN#>恐龙升级模式<#RN#>-射击应用保存的等级设置<#RN#>-鼠标右键保存等级设置<#RN#>-未瞄准时长按鼠标右键清除等级设置","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"2250229213"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "B64FCA33457407BC33F41BB3A094C6B8",
      "Source": "B+Omni-Tool Info",
      "Trans": {"SC":"B+多功能遥控器信息","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"2722019064"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "59F83CBF4AF92F329A0D73A8AA6D5269",
      "Source": "Hold Reload (PC: R) to open the mode select UI.<#RN#><#RN#>You can clone this tool via the item context menu (PC: right click the item)<#RN#><#RN#>Basic Transfer<#RN#>- Targeting (PC: Right Click) to set a structure as a source inventory<#RN#>- Fire (PC: Left Click) to transfer everything from the source to the target<#RN#>- Targeting while holding Drag (PC: G) to set yourself as the source inventory<#RN#>- Fire while holding Drag to transfer from target to yourself<#RN#>- Fire while holding Left Alt to transfer 1 stack (works with Drag as well)<#RN#><#RN#>Advanced Transfer<#RN#>- Fire to open Transfer UI<#RN#>- Targeting to perform last opened adanced transfer<#RN#><#RN#>Inventory Assistant<#RN#>- Fire to open Inventory Assistant UI<#RN#>- Targeting to toggle activation<#RN#>- Drag to clean according to your settings immediately<#RN#><#RN#>Dedicated Storage <#RN#>- Fire to send your target's inventory to any nearby B+Dedicated Storages<#RN#>- Targeting to send your inventory to any nearby B+Dedicated Storages<#RN#><#RN#>Teleporter<#RN#>- Fire to open Teleport UI<#RN#>- Targeting to drop a beacon that you & other tribe members can teleport to<#RN#>- Drag to drop an area teleport beacon (it will teleport a short time after placing)<#RN#><#RN#>Gene Scanner - Press Alt Fire to change modes",
      "Trans": {"SC":"按住换弹键（PC：R）打开模式选择界面。<#RN#><#RN#>你可以通过物品右键菜单（PC：右键点击物品）克隆此工具<#RN#><#RN#>基础转移<#RN#>- 瞄准（PC：右键）将结构设为源背包<#RN#>- 射击（PC：左键）将源的所有物品转移到目标<#RN#>- 按住拖拽键（PC：G）时瞄准将自己设为源背包<#RN#>- 按住拖拽键时射击将目标物品转移到自己背包<#RN#>- 按住左Alt时射击转移1组（可与拖拽键配合）<#RN#><#RN#>高级转移<#RN#>- 射击打开转移界面<#RN#>- 瞄准执行上次打开的高级转移<#RN#><#RN#>背包助手<#RN#>- 射击打开背包助手界面<#RN#>- 瞄准切换激活状态<#RN#>- 拖拽键立即按你的设置清理<#RN#><#RN#>专用存储模式 <#RN#>- 射击将目标的背包物品发送到附近的B+专用存储箱<#RN#>- 瞄准将自己的背包物品发送到附近的B+专用存储箱<#RN#><#RN#>传送器<#RN#>- 射击打开传送界面<#RN#>- 瞄准放置一个你和部落成员可传送的信标<#RN#>- 拖拽键放置区域传送信标（放置后不久将触发传送）<#RN#><#RN#>基因扫描仪 - 按鼠标右键更改模式","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"1984457365"}
    },
